**Of the twenty-one claims this file settles, no design claim survived as design.** Every one of the eight pattern claims tested — the "ten" numerology, the verb-per-movement scheme, the Exodus–Genesis frame, the Judges block, the Genesis programme, the עָזַב chain, the descent/ascent pair, the יָדַע concentration, the betrothal type-scene, the narratorial cluster, and both new registers — was withdrawn or reduced to an observation. Every exclusive single wording contact that was tested held, and three were sharpened. That is the same split the Lamentations audit produced, and it is now a pattern across books worth stating in the standing rule: **this project's single contacts are reliable and its pattern claims are not.**

